==Battleground==
*10 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 2~16 seconds<sup>60f~480f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~30 seconds<sup>120f~900f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 26.67~43.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use anti-angels like [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]]. Any of the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] work well. Otherwise, just use meatshields and high range attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

